 inside the creative workspaces of incredible makers, bringing their processes to life, from ideation to creation. Featuring an eclectic roster of creators including a Broadway and TV puppeteer and a cosplay animatronic wings designer, Adam and the Tested team put viewers inside their workshops for an intimate look at their builds.\n \nAdam Savage\u2019s Tested VR features 8 episodes filmed with 180-degree stereoscopic cameras that allow for an immersive look at the creative process like never before. Bonus footage includes Adam's \"Cave\" workshop tours.\n \nMakers include:\n- Adam Savage, Maker/TV Personality\n- Brett Foxwell, Machinist/Stop-Motion Animator\n- Rick Lyon, Puppeteer & Puppet Designer\n- Melissa Ng, Gothic Armor Designer\n- Andrew Freeman, Creature Mask Sculptor\n- Griffon Ramsey, Chainsaw Wood Sculptor\n- Alexis Noriega, Costume Wing Designer\n- Ryan Nagata, Spacesuit Replica Fabricator", "short_description": "Adam Savage's Tested takes you inside the workshops and maker spaces of incredible creators to learn their processes and watch their awesome builds."}]}, "developer_name": "Whalerock / Lucky Hammers", "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.tested.com/terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "TESTED", "support_website_url": "https://www.tested.com/", "website_url": "https://www.tested.com/", "category": "ENTERTAINMENT", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "ART_CREATIVITY", "EDUCATIONAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED_FOR_DOWNLOAD", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_m